 "summary": "A single P-channel enhancement MOSFET built on a trench process, rated -30 V drain to source and -4 A continuous at 25 °C ambient, in the three-lead SOT23. On-resistance is specified with the gate driven to -10 V, -4.5 V and -2.5 V, at most 50, 60 and 85 mΩ, and it is rated to work from gates as low as 2.5 V. It is intended for load switches and general switching.",
 "key_figures": [
